OL,3,ASelena Gomez pushes back against
OL,4,A'frivolous' fraud claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FGomez is pushing back against those
OL,7,Fallegations - her lawyer has asked that
OL,8,Fshe be dismissed from the case
OL,9,Faltogether, saying the claims made
OL,10,Fagainst her are "threadbare" and
OL,11,Farguing she should never have been
OL,12,F"dragged into" the case at all.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
